{"index":9,"original_task":"R7-M03","original_id":"39:260-275","pointer":"/clauses/191","original_status":"CROSSDOMAIN_PARTIAL","formal_path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","formal_range":[275,275],"current_clause_text":"事件引子仅有效非空 IntroBGM=I 时请求播放：已有备忘保留；没有备忘但有待播计时和有效 Q 时，先取消计时并记 Q/位置0；无待播计时才记当前曲及位置，位置查询失败取0。这些提交先于后段播放，失败不承诺回滚。普通核心把开战请求交过渡包装，胜利请求交对应呈现，野生捕获成功交独立 ME 呈现（已有3.5秒等待仍沿 WP67-A）。抢夺训练家捕获不套野生成功 ME 消费者。准入跳过清备忘而不创建/播放开战呈现；覆写截断使用实际改道入口，不把普通核心消费者补到被跳过的分支。正常返回的备忘/预置清理与异常不保证恢复仍按 §3.4/§7.4及 WP42。","original_fact_ids":[],"original_source":[{"file":"E","path":"Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/002_Battle triggering/001_Overworld_BattleStarting.rb","lines":[401,404]},{"file":"E","path":"Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/002_Battle triggering/001_Overworld_BattleStarting.rb","lines":[521,524]}],"original_consumers":[],"original_premise":"Valid metadata and conversions; no plugin rewrite; all claims are requests only"}
{"index":10,"original_task":"R7-M03","original_id":"40:198-208","pointer":"/clauses/382","original_status":"CROSSDOMAIN_PARTIAL","formal_path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","formal_range":[200,200],"current_clause_text":"普通已选招式的单席位处理有动作内层一般异常诊断边界，位于 WP42 §8 的攻击阶段外层边界之内。日志开关只控制记录，不能由关闭日志推定异常提示被关闭。若招式内部先发生一般异常，而日志、错误格式、提示、输入和刷新等诊断步骤全部正常返回，该内层不显式重抛；随后仍做裁判，按配置重算优先序，并向招式扫描报告一次推进。诊断返回不等于招式正常完成，也不补写已行动轮号。正常结束行动入口才写该轮号；之后的持续能力检查等仍可能出错，因此须观察错误实际发生在写点之前还是之后。","original_fact_ids":[],"original_source":[{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[5,56]},{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[97,113]},{"file":"B9","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/010_Battle_AttackPhase.rb","lines":[102,171]},{"file":"DBG","path":"Data/Scripts/001_Technical/001_Debugging/001_PBDebug.rb","lines":[1,77]}],"original_consumers":[],"original_premise":"StandardError only; diagnostics return normally; completion marker not written before fault; decision remains 0"}
{"index":11,"original_task":"R7-M03","original_id":"40:198-208","pointer":"/clauses/383","original_status":"CROSSDOMAIN_PARTIAL","formal_path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","formal_range":[202,202],"current_clause_text":"每次推进后重新取得当前优先序；序表保留已尝试或已行动条目，由扫描门过滤。扫描先强制先行，再非压后常规，最后按世代处理压后：各组均要求存活、当前选择仍为招式或换位、已行动轮号不等于当前轮，并按该组先行/压后状态筛选；决定正值时退出。错误前未写完成、决定仍 0、选择未清且使用者仍活者可能再次合格。再次选中是重新尝试整次普通使用，重新检查资格/服从并按普通 PP 规则处理，不是恢复中断的第二击；不是每个异常都必再扣 PP。","original_fact_ids":[],"original_source":[{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[5,56]},{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[97,113]},{"file":"B9","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/010_Battle_AttackPhase.rb","lines":[102,171]},{"file":"DBG","path":"Data/Scripts/001_Technical/001_Debugging/001_PBDebug.rb","lines":[1,77]}],"original_consumers":[],"original_premise":"StandardError only; diagnostics return normally; completion marker not written before fault; decision remains 0"}
{"index":12,"original_task":"R7-M03","original_id":"40:198-208","pointer":"/clauses/384","original_status":"CROSSDOMAIN_PARTIAL","formal_path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","formal_range":[204,204],"current_clause_text":"有限静态例沿 WP47-A §3.1.1 的 U04-NG01 全部正常合法状态和排除门：普通 1v1、无变体/覆写/插件、默认 NATURALGIFT 真实槽，使用者非变身、本轮未动，真实与场上 PP 均 5，无额外压力；初始决定 0。两次前置资格及服从通过；每次重取的有效优先序 U 均先于 T，没有竞争先行、压后、戏法空间/速度改写、换人、选择改写、多回合覆盖或外部状态干预。诊断、其后裁判/配置重排和第二次失败结束清理都正常返回；无等离子浴/输电等类型覆盖。","original_fact_ids":[],"original_source":[{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[5,56]},{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[97,113]},{"file":"B9","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/010_Battle_AttackPhase.rb","lines":[102,171]},{"file":"DBG","path":"Data/Scripts/001_Technical/001_Debugging/001_PBDebug.rb","lines":[1,77]}],"original_consumers":[],"original_premise":"StandardError only; diagnostics return normally; completion marker not written before fault; decision remains 0"}
{"index":13,"original_task":"R7-M03","original_id":"40:198-208","pointer":"/clauses/385","original_status":"CROSSDOMAIN_PARTIAL","formal_path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","formal_range":[206,206],"current_clause_text":"第一次 PP5→4，首击目标正损失及记录、JABO 反伤 20、ORAN 回复 10 和消费都已提交，U81→61→71；当前物品及相同还原物清空，回收/拾取和吃果记录保留。第二击空物身份访问失败早于该击 HP 和行动完成轮号写入。内层诊断返回后双方可战、决定仍 0，重新扫描再选 U；第二次前门过，PP4→3，重算一般类型和使用记录，安全的无树果整招门反馈失败、取消连用并正常写本轮已动。在 T 尚未行动的观察点，真实与场上 PP3、U71、首击消费前缀保持，T 没有第二次新损失。之后 U 被已行动门跳过；其它候选正常处理且无新干预时本阶段可结束。这一有限终止依第二次正常失败及已动门，不依调试的 100 回合上限。","original_fact_ids":[],"original_source":[{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[5,56]},{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[97,113]},{"file":"B9","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/010_Battle_AttackPhase.rb","lines":[102,171]},{"file":"DBG","path":"Data/Scripts/001_Technical/001_Debugging/001_PBDebug.rb","lines":[1,77]}],"original_consumers":[],"original_premise":"StandardError only; diagnostics return normally; completion marker not written before fault; decision remains 0"}
{"index":14,"original_task":"R7-M03","original_id":"40:198-208","pointer":"/clauses/386","original_status":"CROSSDOMAIN_PARTIAL","formal_path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","formal_range":[208,208],"current_clause_text":"独立对照：起始 PP1，第一次到 0，第二次无 PP 拒绝不再减并正常写已动；去有效亲子爱，正常单击 PP5→4、U71 并已动，没有该续击异常；第二次前置拒绝则不再扣 PP、按正常拒绝结束写已动。已经写本轮已动后才出错、决定已正、使用者失能、选择改型/清除或换位，须按实际门重判，不能只凭捕获推重试。裸普通使用调用没有此单席位包装时，错误向其实际调用者传播，不自行产生调度重试；号令/舞者等嵌套入口按各自保存恢复规则。诊断自己失败、非一般异常或包裹外错误可能到更外层，不保证 PP3、完整清理、进程退出、宿主恢复或任意异常集合的全局终止性。全部为未执行的有限静态后继。","original_fact_ids":[],"original_source":[{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[5,56]},{"file":"T6","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/002_Battler/007_Battler_UseMove.rb","lines":[97,113]},{"file":"B9","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/001_Battle/010_Battle_AttackPhase.rb","lines":[102,171]},{"file":"DBG","path":"Data/Scripts/001_Technical/001_Debugging/001_PBDebug.rb","lines":[1,77]}],"original_consumers":[],"original_premise":"StandardError only; diagnostics return normally; completion marker not written before fault; decision remains 0"}
