{"id": "GR7-M05-001", "canonical_id": "GR7-M05-001", "aliases": [], "classification": "required", "severity_proposed": "MEDIUM", "status": "REQUIRED_OPEN_FOR_MANUAL_UPDATE", "proposer": "R7-M05", "source_proposal_path": "tasks/R7-M05/findings.json", "original_proposal": {"id": "GR7-M05-001", "status": "PROPOSED", "author": "R7-M05", "independent_validation": "PENDING_ROOT_OR_OTHER_NONAUTHOR; this author's countersearch is not independent confirmation", "title": "玩家撞墙建立的运动完成后仍进入玩家计步链，正文将碰撞压缩为音效/计数/标记而遗漏这条可观察边界", "type": "BEHAVIORAL_COVERAGE_GAP_WITH_OVERRESTRICTIVE_SUMMARY", "severity": "MEDIUM", "priority": "P2", "severity_reason": "普通默认 Repel 等步进效果可在零位移撞墙完成时推进；独立实现若把步数严格绑定成功位移，会改变道具时长与周期效果。不是纯排版问题，也不据此声称宿主事故或默认毒伤。", "source": [{"path": "Data/Scripts/004_Game classes/008_Game_Player.rb", "lines": [121, 177], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "8f49870b94fdda6dbb53cbaeebfaf458498cd02d"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/004_Game classes/006_Game_Character.rb", "lines": [893, 992], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "9de49c288ec6c5d8c962b14f1b959ad90ae3d662"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/004_Game classes/008_Game_Player.rb", "lines": [416, 429], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "8f49870b94fdda6dbb53cbaeebfaf458498cd02d"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/004_Game classes/008_Game_Player.rb", "lines": [543, 554], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "8f49870b94fdda6dbb53cbaeebfaf458498cd02d"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/001_Overworld.rb", "lines": [172, 187], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "e95754925d6eea2735a22e9dfe5a8414fc7e3ab6"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/013_Items/002_Item_Effects.rb", "lines": [147, 167], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "cad2fc8d57960b79088eb19e92ff97ae9203e6df"}], "spec": [{"path": "deliverables/final-specification-set/engine-overworld/wp12-terrain-movement-vehicles.md", "lines": [98, 109], "clause": "§4.1 普通移动/碰撞入口及开始-完成说明"}, {"path": "deliverables/final-specification-set/engine-overworld/wp12-terrain-movement-vehicles.md", "lines": [227, 232], "clause": "§8 碰撞仅音效/计数/标记摘要"}, {"path": "deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp61-field-passive-effects-and-blackout.md", "lines": [15, 17], "clause": "§2 全局步数入口口径"}, {"path": "deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp61-field-passive-effects-and-blackout.md", "lines": [24, 44], "clause": "§3.1-3.2 完成调用与消费者"}, {"path": "deliverables/final-specification-set/test-catalog/engine-overworld-wp11-15-59-60.md", "lines": [41, 42], "clause": "MV01/MV02"}, {"path": "deliverables/final-specification-set/test-catalog/pokemon-rules-wp53-60-61-62-69-70.md", "lines": [81, 85], "clause": "FP01-05 completion vectors"}], "premise": "Use vector BP01 in full, including initial facing direction and absent encounter/automatic/forced/interpreter gates; keep start and completion observations separate. The normal case uses default field-poison-off configuration and does not need poison or custom code.", "source_fact": "A failed cardinal player attempt without successful touch creates a timed collision motion at unchanged logical coordinates. Character update later clears that motion, sends a general step notification and marks this update as moved. Player post-update sees that flag, passes its no-current-motion/automatic-movement gate and calls player step handling without requiring coordinate change. Normal player handling increments the global counter and publishes player notifications; the non-ice Repel consumer decrements.", "ordinary_control": "An unobstructed cardinal step also increments after completion but has an earlier logical displacement/distance increment. A failed diagonal or successful touch has no new collision motion and cannot be substituted.", "minimal_counterexample": {"id": "GR7-M05-BP01", "case": "collision normal completion", "input": "20x20 valid map; player (5,5) facing right, ordinary walk, current ordinary ground, (6,5) all-direction blocked, no events/through/debug/encounter/ice/waterfall/forced route/interpreter/menu/plugin/unrelated writes; one healthy non-egg creature; global count 0, friendship counter 0, repel 2, distance D, bump count B. One right attempt, then release directions and allow uninterrupted valid updates, each delta <=0.25, until the collision motion completes.", "expected": "At attempt return: position/distance unchanged, bump B+1, moving true, global count 0 and repel 2. At completion: general step notification then player chain, global count 1, friendship counter 1, repel 1; position (5,5), distance D. No leave-tile notification from this collision request.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, "normal_cancel_failure_partial_commit": [{"id": "GR7-M05-BP01", "case": "collision normal completion", "input": "20x20 valid map; player (5,5) facing right, ordinary walk, current ordinary ground, (6,5) all-direction blocked, no events/through/debug/encounter/ice/waterfall/forced route/interpreter/menu/plugin/unrelated writes; one healthy non-egg creature; global count 0, friendship counter 0, repel 2, distance D, bump count B. One right attempt, then release directions and allow uninterrupted valid updates, each delta <=0.25, until the collision motion completes.", "expected": "At attempt return: position/distance unchanged, bump B+1, moving true, global count 0 and repel 2. At completion: general step notification then player chain, global count 1, friendship counter 1, repel 1; position (5,5), distance D. No leave-tile notification from this collision request.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP02", "case": "ordinary successful contrast", "input": "BP01 but target passable, no ledge/surf logic, all relevant steps return normally.", "expected": "Logical position (6,5) and distance D+1 at movement start, bump B; after completion global count 1/repel 1. Same later counters do not imply same displacement.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP03", "case": "before-completion contrast", "input": "BP01 collision exists, observe before elapsed motion threshold, no extra updates or writes.", "expected": "Bump count committed, global/repel unchanged; do not move completion-side effects to collision creation.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP04", "case": "touch-success suppresses collision", "input": "Blocked cardinal attempt; player touch check succeeds and starts a valid event; no preexisting motion or extra state writes.", "expected": "Collision creation branch is not taken; this request does not create the collision completion/step chain. Event effects and later unrelated updates are separate.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP05", "case": "failed diagonal contrast", "input": "BP01 but one fixed segment of a direct diagonal request is blocked; no preexisting motion; direction-fix false.", "expected": "Direction may change, but no collision timer/count and no completion step from this attempt. Do not generalize from cardinal collision to every failed move.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP06", "case": "forced-route completion contrast", "input": "BP01 collision under forced player route with following WAIT keeping forcing true through collision completion; no automatic terrain or interruption.", "expected": "Collision count still committed; general completion notification and forced player early branch apply, but no global/player-cycle/repel advance. Existing MR02 state-based route advancement remains correct.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP07", "case": "failure after partial commit", "input": "BP01, but at completion the first general-step consumer deterministically raises before returning; no mutation by that failing consumer.", "expected": "Collision count already B+1 and movement timer already cleared. Player step phase is not reached, so no global/repel increment; no rollback or game-resume guarantee. This is an explicit injected failure premise, not default behavior.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}, {"id": "GR7-M05-BP08", "case": "no completion opportunity / interruption boundary", "input": "BP01 collision creation returns, then no qualified completion update is delivered (or task observes before any such update). No added cancellation API is assumed.", "expected": "Only actual committed prefix is asserted. No unconditional eventual player counter increment, automatic cancellation cleanup or rollback is promised.", "execution": "NOT_EXECUTED"}], "necessary_consumers": [{"path": "Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/001_Overworld.rb", "lines": [69, 80], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "e95754925d6eea2735a22e9dfe5a8414fc7e3ab6"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/013_Items/002_Item_Effects.rb", "lines": [147, 167], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "cad2fc8d57960b79088eb19e92ff97ae9203e6df"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/012_Overworld/001_Overworld.rb", "lines": [172, 187], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "e95754925d6eea2735a22e9dfe5a8414fc7e3ab6"}, {"path": "Data/Scripts/004_Game classes/008_Game_Player.rb", "lines": [543, 554], "commit": "8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b", "git_blob": "8f49870b94fdda6dbb53cbaeebfaf458498cd02d"}], "negative_evidence": {"formal_scope": "All 131 files under deliverables/final-specification-set searched, including WP06/WP12/WP61 and both relevant catalogs; full primary reading independently completed.", "source_scope": "All Data/Scripts searched for collision/step producer overrides and cross-call identifiers; actual full reads of primary character/player/overworld plus exact Repel consumer.", "commands": ["logs/final-negative-locate.json", "logs/negative-candidates.json", "logs/final-source-search.json"], "result": "Existing MR02/WP13 route rule acknowledges collision's moving state only for route-index advancement. WP06 cites completi