{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/0","id":"F18-SPECIES","fact":"物种与形态身份、字段缺省、继承及形态记录回退分别属于内容构造、编译和读取阶段。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/1","id":"F18-FORM","fact":"物种同基身份短路；形态三入口的回调、重算和图鉴副作用不同；按个体取图会先求动态形态。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/2","id":"F18-CREATE","fact":"创建的身份、数值、来源和容器初值，以及末尾重算及有条件形态复检。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/3","id":"F18-NPC","fact":"普通训练家条目先创建无默认招式成员，再按固定顺序覆盖，缺省槽位/性别/性格/IV/EV有各自规则。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/4","id":"F18-CLONE","fact":"复制保留个人身份；六项培养容器、招式、首招、Owner记录和缎带独立复制，未重建对象仍可共享。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/5","id":"F18-OWNER","fact":"Owner直接/训练家/外来构造与字段写入的校验、语言来源、公开号和同值参数遮蔽例外。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/6","id":"F18-OBTAIN","fact":"外来比较只读ID及名字；来源与时间写入独立；昵称清除与尺寸读取不改变来源。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/7","id":"F18-SIZE","fact":"毫米辅助仅依赖原始IV低四位、PID低两字节和有效高度，具有两次整数阶段及15个区间。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/8","id":"F19-TYPE-GENDER","fact":"类型为形态内容副本；性别按固定比例/PID低字节派生，显式设置带单性别守卫。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/9","id":"F19-SHINY","fact":"普通与超级异色各自计算缓存；超级真可写普通真，但清空/覆盖与输入改变不自动同步。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/10","id":"F19-ABILITY","fact":"特性候选保留原槽索引，隐藏缺位解析回落不改已存索引；显式特性不校验物种归属。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/11","id":"F19-NATURE","fact":"表现性格与能力计算覆盖独立；25登记序和修正表决定派生与能力值；无参查询只看当前缓存。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/12","id":"F19-LEVEL","fact":"等级缓存由经验读取求值，等级写入带边界，经验直接写不夹限；非法换算的错误对象与名称错误不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/13","id":"F19-STATS","fact":"有效IV/EV、两级整除、HP为1特例与HP差额写回确定六项能力。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/14","id":"F19-EV","fact":"培养增量夹限与普通训练家显式校验不同于设施按努力项数整分，后者可写255并丢余数。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/15","id":"F20-HP","fact":"HP写入夹限；归零清异常通过蛋守卫并清准备标记；Shadow叠加清Hyper。单项与全治疗边界不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/16","id":"F20-STATUS","fact":"状态设置先检查可用，再解析和写规范身份；状态计数独立；世界结束与捕获旧成员清毒计数。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/17","id":"F20-MOVES","fact":"招式整表存储可空或大于4；默认重置和静默学习各自有有界规则，按索引删除接受负索引。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/18","id":"F20-FIRST","fact":"首招整表记录保留重复和顺序；逐项添加不重复；TR背包包装成功后追加，队伍包装不追加。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/19","id":"F20-RELEARN","fact":"兼容与可重学判定读取不同数据，界面更多招式开关只影响首招候选附加。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/20","id":"F20-PP","fact":"招式总PP由基础值及计数整分派生；换招和PP提升会夹当前PP，过负计数可部分写入后失败。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/21","id":"F20-ZERO","fact":"空招式可以在模型中存在，摘要列表可绘空位但详情和直接遗忘会先读取缺失首招；空槽学习仍成功。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/22","id":"F20-ITEM","fact":"持物字段未知输入静默忽略；战斗字段未知输入解析空并写穿；读邮件可因物品不一致清除。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/23","id":"F20-RESTORE","fact":"终局按届时位置记录还原持物；捕获入队登记物品，满队删除与伙伴合并可产生身份错位。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/24","id":"F24-IDENTITY","fact":"训练家ID、公秘号、语言、类型派生及玩家元数据回退和原始外观写入独立。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/25","id":"F24-RESOURCES","fact":"资源后续整数写入夹限；StartMoney创建直取，徽章计数严格为真；战斗金钱分阶段按实际变化统计。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/26","id":"F24-ASH","fact":"一次已到达通用迈步先按2/1/0找首煤灰层；只有玩家持袋采集，擦层不依采集成功。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/27","id":"F24-LOAD","fact":"训练家装载按类型/名字/版本，未知类型报错、记录缺失为空；检查与调试新增入口不等于装载。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/28","id":"F24-AUDIO","fact":"野生/训练家曲目按不同字段和回退选请求；引子先选择记忆，曲目选择不清预置。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/29","id":"F24-PARTNER","fact":"伙伴注册有取消载具、装载、钩子、Owner重设和槽替换的先后；实际战斗参加谓词与可双/三打查询不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/30","id":"F24-RADAR","fact":"伙伴不阻雷达启动；后续候选钩子伙伴门清链，前段统计和电量不回滚。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/31","id":"F25-CAPACITY","fact":"盒长可变，计数与空满由当前长度定义；容量查询负地址分支与实际寻址不一致。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/32","id":"F25-REGION","fact":"地区代理仅按地图变更重解析；移动转复制、删除及墙纸代理的失败与基础容器不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/33","id":"F25-WALL","fact":"墙纸可用性由基本目录/解锁记录决定；显示读取会转换旧文本或写入可用背景回退。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/34","id":"F25-OPERATIONS","fact":"基础复制同引用，队伍追加忽略目标格；盒可覆盖/扩展；移动仅在复制成功后删除源，捕获存储依当前盒优先。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/35","id":"F25-UI","fact":"仓库逻辑的最后可用、邮件、不可存放、不可释放和蛋守卫按操作/来源/持有分层。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/36","id":"F25-PERSIST","fact":"玩家和储存作为持久根保存；存入治疗保准备标记；旧标记转换按既有持久对象访问。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/37","id":"F26-ACQUIRE","fact":"普通/静默/仅队伍/外来/蛋获得的守卫、写序、消息和返回各异；交互链有多次容量复检。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/38","id":"F26-TRADE","fact":"脚本交换先统计/修改收到者，再演出及图鉴/进化，最后替换队伍槽；物种与实例分支不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/39","id":"F26-SELECT","fact":"指定交换选择器给定物种过滤并排蛋/Shadow/不可交换；包装写事件变量，取消不返回成员索引。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/40","id":"F26-GIFT","fact":"神秘礼物领取在静默获得前修改同一礼物个体，静默成功后才消费条目，随后独立条件图鉴展示。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/41","id":"F26-CAPTURE","fact":"捕获复用原个体并补球/首招/形态清理，队列终局登记后由peer入队或送箱。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/42","id":"F19-CHARACTER","fact":"摘要个性读取原始最高IV，以PID起始环序打破并列并用余5选择语义。"}
{"task":"R7-M02","ptr":"/facts/43","id":"F18-WILD","fact":"野生创建在普通创建后分配物品、可清普通异色重掷PID、病毒及领队覆盖，再冻结动态形态并发创建事件；特殊IV重掷由事件消费。"}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/0","id":"MAP-LOAD","fact":"Map setup loads data and tileset, sends setup notification before constructing runtime events; identifier queries may create nonresident maps."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/1","id":"MAP-TOPOLOGY","fact":"Bidirectional connections normalize anchors, select the first valid mapped position and calculate relative/display offsets; missing dimensions are cached as zero."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/2","id":"MAP-LIFECYCLE","fact":"Setup, connected-edge transfer and pruning have different ordering and reuse rules; moving suspends edge switching and pruning."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/3","id":"MAP-TRANSFER","fact":"Queued 201 and its two scene consumers preserve swimming; direct scene transfer defaults to cancelling it. Autofade can fail before map reconstruction."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/4","id":"MAP-RESTORE","fact":"Load chooses setup versus resident reuse, sends enter-map notification and later invokes local-record recovery; enter-map setup clears local records first."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/5","id":"MAP-NAME","fact":"Map name localization can return mutable stored text; player-name expansion changes that selected text; basic name and continue preview have separate readers."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/6","id":"MAP-LOCATION","fact":"Location prompt requires valid scene, changed map and announcement metadata; history can suppress it. Fly destination blocks update before timeout/disposal gates."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/7","id":"PASSABILITY","fact":"Passability is entry-specific: map tile events, player/NPC terrain, double-ended character checks, strict checks, boundary and debug gates differ."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/8","id":"MOVEMENT","fact":"Cardinal movement may turn, move, touch or create collision motion. Ordinary movement commits position/distance before completion; zero/nonzero jumps and diagonal attempts differ."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/9","id":"MOVEMENT-COMPLETION","fact":"Collision motion can complete at unchanged coordinates, send general step notification and enter player step handling; global/player counters depend on later guards, not displacement."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/10","id":"MOVEMENT-CHOICE","fact":"NPC random/range/approach behavior filters directions or selects a center-based primary axis; no pathfinding or collision retry guarantee."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/11","id":"MOVEMENT-INPUT","fact":"Direction input, automatic movement, command installation and scene-end request registration/consumption have separate gates and ordering."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/12","id":"VEHICLES","fact":"Vehicle flags choose appearance/speed and cancellation/entry behavior; running eligibility and forced routes impose independent gates."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/13","id":"SURF","fact":"Surf start commits flags/count/base before attempting a forward jump; ending cleanup requires a qualified later player step notification and nonempty base."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/14","id":"ICE-WATERFALL","fact":"Ice sliding checks terrain, direction passability and debug interruption; waterfall ascent activation and per-step cleanup have direction/state gates."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/15","id":"EVENT-PAGES","fact":"Event page selection is reverse priority; same page short-circuits, valid replacement resets route state, and no-page uses a different cleanup branch."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/16","id":"EVENT-TRIGGERS","fact":"Action, player touch, NPC touch and name-based sight/counter detection differ; over-trigger is a passability-dependent predicate, not merely through."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/17","id":"EVENT-PRIVATE-TIME","fact":"Private event cooldowns use strict seconds or calendar-adjusted fixed-day arithmetic; registration samples once and writes self-switch before timestamp."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/18","id":"INTERPRETER","fact":"Interpreter waits, lost-map context, child processing, loop protection, command advancement and current-map versus bound-map identities are distinct."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/19","id":"INTERPRETER-MESSAGES","fact":"Text pre-read, continuation consumption, repeated-loop failure, choice concatenation and visible-index mapping happen at separate stages."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/20","id":"INTERPRETER-COMMANDS","fact":"The full command dispatch contains implemented, marker, no-op and fallback cases; parameter, wait and side-effect contracts must be read from each actual definition."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/21","id":"ERASURE","fact":"Instance erase, recorded script helper and command 116 have different object/existence/index gates; stored movement snapshots restore through outside the map-match gate."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/22","id":"CUTSCENE","fact":"SPECIAL skip matches exact annotation text, writes bound self-switch A then ends and requests restart; scene-end shortcut handling can independently occur later."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/23","id":"ROUTE","fact":"Forced route installs synchronously, saves/restores an earlier nonnil route, distinguishes empty route, movement-state advancement, wait and literal line prefixes."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/24","id":"FOLLOWERS","fact":"Follower lifecycle, following chain, conditional displacement, transfer visibility and special interaction/door routes are separate supported behaviors."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/25","id":"DUNGEON-INPUT","fact":"Dungeon setup uses metadata, parameter dual-key/default lookup, tileset first-entry fallback and one-shot global seed consumption; odd large-grid parameters fail before seed selection."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/26","id":"DUNGEON-LAYOUT","fact":"Dungeon node masks, directed extra-edge sampling, room geometry and connectivity redraw have bounded input-specific behavior; room candidates survive redraw."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/27","id":"DUNGEON-WALLS","fact":"Wall lookup is a finite mask mapping; local error repair is ordered and layer-sensitive, with redraw/exception prefixes instead of global success guarantees."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/28","id":"DUNGEON-DECOR","fact":"Decoration attempts use distinct sampling domains/density divisors; mapped zero density fails during generation. Tile conversion and event/player placement have partial-commit boundaries."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/29","id":"DUNGEON-DATA","fact":"PBS sample cave/forest parameters and tileset 7/23 differ from an unregistered default parameter object; constructor omission and schema validation are separate."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/30","id":"TIME","fact":"World wall-clock reads, overlapping time predicates, season modulo, moonphase arithmetic, zodiac gaps and shading cache/application gates are independently specified."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/31","id":"WEATHER","fact":"Weather intentions have type/power/duration; enter-map rerolls only on real old/new map difference and connected-edge transfer later overwrites duration."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/32","id":"WEATHER-DISPLAY","fact":"Scene display submits only type differences; active fades reject new fades, positive duration selects a fixed phased fade, and particles/splash/sun/storm have special updates."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/33","id":"WEATHER-EDITOR","fact":"Weather editor None/cancel returns empty edit value, with registration/save only after outer property-list confirmation."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/34","id":"FIELD-ENTRY","fact":"Field abilities have distinct eligibility/confirmation/effect stages; party menu and ready menu consume these stages differently from direct tools."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/35","id":"FIELD-PUSH","fact":"Strength push strict preflight precedes count, ordinary move, local snapshot and conditional sound/player lock/wait/unlock."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/36","id":"FIELD-TRANSFER","fact":"Dig, dive/surface, fly and teleport differ in target, direction, music, count and tail clearing; fly callback can fail after transfer and before record clearing."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/37","id":"FIELD-PRESENTATION","fact":"Field animation and cave animation have nominal monotonic stages and update opportunities; successful animation is not a universal effect-success contract."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/38","id":"FISHING","fact":"Fishing coordinator increments count, samples stage-specific randomness, uses timed dots/input priority and performs normal shared cleanup; direct calls do not automatically request an encounter."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/39","id":"FISHING-ENTRY","fact":"Rod item callbacks test facing terrain and current outgoing map passability, then consume a true fishing result by incrementing battle count and requesting the rod encounter type."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/40","id":"FISHING-COMMON","fact":"Global common-event helper returns true after completion and rejects negative ID; interpreter-local helper returns no value and uses actual array indexing."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/41","id":"FISHING-BATTLE","fact":"Fishing type feeds facing-tile battle environment, water intro location and lure-ball modifier; these are consumers rather than fishing-loop side effects."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/42","id":"BERRY-STATE","fact":"Plant state reset/plant/replant and frozen mechanics, watering, yield, elapsed-time catch-up, mulch and dry-hour penalties are distinct contracts."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/43","id":"BERRY-DISPLAY","fact":"Ordinary sprite updates advance only new-mechanics plants, and graphic/sparkle changes depend on stage/resource gates."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/44","id":"BERRY-UI","fact":"Berry interaction branches by maturity; fertilization commits before later cancellation, and picking captures quantity before confirmation then commits stats/inventory/switch before outer reset."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/45","id":"PASSIVE-STEP","fact":"Player step processing increments global count before notifications unless forced-route/interpreter early branch applies; consumers include friendship, repel, poison and general terrain effects."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/46","id":"PASSIVE-FRAME","fact":"Pokérus day update, battery warning, delayed music and phone/contest callbacks have independent frame gates and state lifetimes."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/47","id":"POKERUS","fact":"Virus encoding, reinfection/reset/cure and daily non-egg reduction differ; battle spread fixes original infected source indices after capture reception."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/48","id":"BLACKOUT","fact":"Ordinary blackout checks contest first, then counts/heals before destination resolution. Missing home map returns early; absent home still reaches escape-point clearing."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/49","id":"HEALING","fact":"Full healing skips eggs, restores HP/status/all PP and clears ready-to-evolve; storage healing explicitly restores saved evolution readiness when configured."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/50","id":"PASSIVE-OTHER","fact":"General notification clears one soot layer independently of collecting soot; Shadow step loop and purification chamber update have separate gates; registered step consumers run in script registration order."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/51","id":"CONFIG","fact":"Current generation 8 defaults disable field poison and storage healing, enable newer berries/time shading and define rod/common-event/badge values."}
{"task":"R7-M05","ptr":"/facts/52","id":"RENDERING","fact":"Map renderer handles autotile layout/frames, texture wrapping and tile-neighbor lookup; native rendering and actual media remain unexecuted."}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/0","id":"F01","fact":"图像按png/gif候选和首字节可读性解析；解析空值、原名后备、六后缀音频与四后缀SE解析是不同入口。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/1","id":"F02","fact":"消息/菜单默认皮肤首次求值和显式设置分别缓存逻辑结果；单窗换肤缺图提前返回，不重走默认候选。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/2","id":"F03","fact":"图像变体候选按闪光、暗影、性别、形态、物种的二进制组合次序查找；蛋、脚印、影子另有形态数据门和专用后备。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/3","id":"F04","fact":"从个体取正背图、图标先读取普通形态，可能先写形态；资源失败不回滚前缀；个体位图回调只在获得图后应用。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/4","id":"F05","fact":"训练家资源要求登记身份；玩家装束后缀独立回退到基础资源。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/5","id":"F06","fact":"道具空值、未知值、机器类型和持物/邮件提示有独立资源后备；固定位图名不证明文件可加载。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/6","id":"F07","fact":"直接缓存、普通动画包装、前缀条带、nil、消费中的内嵌图像各有不同加载失败边界；共享有效内容与复制内容隔离分开。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/7","id":"F08","fact":"数字前缀横条动画按创建时原点和d/20秒更新；静止化回0；尺寸/帧数校验在加载之后。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/8","id":"F09","fact":"音频字符串解析支持音量/音调字段，通用播放包装会用独立缺省100覆盖字符串嵌入参数；预解析记录保留未覆盖参数。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/9","id":"F10","fact":"系统四声道缩放、缺失登记与宿主请求分开；BGM默认覆盖；帧重置尾部只在BGM/BGS/ME入口，停止和包装提前返回另分。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/10","id":"F11","fact":"BGM暂停位置、BGS无位置恢复、记忆别名及选项改写BGS音量的二次缩放需分开。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/11","id":"F12","fact":"提示曲目替换保留在途计时；到期只在当前无登记时播放且不重试；显式传送和边缘换图的自动播放入口不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/12","id":"F13","fact":"叫声按物种/形态/后缀解析，时长入口允许后缀缺失退标准；公开时长夹负值而不统一捕获损坏文件。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/13","id":"F14","fact":"系统四种UI音效优先登记值；关闭菜单只查默认文件。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/14","id":"F15","fact":"指定UI图像先选择翻译身份再解析/加载，没有资源缺失后统一原身份重试；固定背景独立。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/15","id":"F16","fact":"战斗背景与消息条独立查时段；平台共用由base0选择的前缀，不独立依据base1换前缀。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/16","id":"F17","fact":"世界图片呈现所有100条，业务按战斗状态只更新一半；显示重设状态、擦除保留数值；移动用游戏钟，旋转用运行钟。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/17","id":"F18","fact":"计时器起点存在才显示，夹显示不夹业务，停止不要求清旧初始时长。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/18","id":"F19","fact":"角色图块/4x4字符图、灌木分支、透明/日夜门、角色坐标、更新许可及动画标记消费各有入口前提。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/19","id":"F20","fact":"倒影受父可见及高度控制，桥/固定高度、色彩/透明度和摆动条件分开。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/20","id":"F21","fact":"冲浪/潜水基点跟随过渡或父坐标，不沿父visible；两状态均真时冲浪优先。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/21","id":"F22","fact":"普通地图逐图/全局显示层分开，传送重建逐图显示并保留全局显示和图片计时业务。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/22","id":"F23","fact":"世界动画帧基于单次开始时刻，跳帧不补定时；位置/层高/单元、屏幕重复抑制、清表、坐标广播失败前缀分开。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/23","id":"F24","fact":"动态阴影的注释读取、事件列表形状失败、玩家逐光源输入及传送清理是不同分支。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/24","id":"F25","fact":"图片演出轨道首次更新起钟、到期登记序取样、相对终点及回调前缀；消费者聚合完成多一次观察。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/25","id":"F26","fact":"窗口资源/皮肤格式/透明度/裁剪与字体配置影响呈现；主文不要求源窗口组织方式。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/26","id":"F27","fact":"普通文本窗口无格式化，格式化窗口布局及逐字推进、暂停、滚动、等待守卫互相独立。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/27","id":"F28","fact":"数字编辑先方向后USE；符号、初值夹限、取消值及setter顺序各自独立。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/28","id":"F29","fact":"列表移动和按下沿回绕，与普通/带帮助选择BACK先于USE的出口裁决分开；nil与空数组不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/29","id":"F30","fact":"绘制识别21个标记，19个处理；颜色、字体、对齐、不透明度栈与计数按调用初始化。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/30","id":"F31","fact":"自动换行按词边界和额外2单位门；行首长词不硬拆；消息依生成换行插行满暂停。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/31","id":"F32","fact":"图像标记必须到达主循环位置才消费，单独或文尾未消费不生成；消费后的测量/绘制加载异常不被统一归空。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/32","id":"F33","fact":"直接无标记格式化走普通路径不解实体，一般路径按固定顺序替换；去格式入口始终替换。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/33","id":"F34","fact":"消息预处理顺序、皮肤空值、性别色、控制与起始SE/滑入分支、四态恢复和关闭互相独立。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/34","id":"F35","fact":"字符编辑按字符限制新增，不截初值；键盘/自由文本出口、宿主输入开关及多行编辑不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/35","id":"F36","fact":"命名两模式、准确字符网格、导航/同轮优先序、非正上限首次更新失败按不同入口分别处理。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/36","id":"F37","fact":"输入别名、F8与鼠标窗口门是参考层请求；宿主重复与物理组合未执行。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/37","id":"F38","fact":"暂停/导航箭头采用全局相位，专用物品/个体/物种/盒格图标周期和空值门不同。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/38","id":"F39","fact":"命名行走预览第一行4帧周期.5秒，箱图横4帧周期.4秒，解析缺图可空，外层还可有依赖失败。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/39","id":"F40","fact":"局部两行消息/确认存在忙暂停不能恢复分支；共享静态帮助、商店、队伍/摘要普通显示分别处理。"}
{"task":"R7-M06","ptr":"/facts/40","id":"F41","fact":"解释器只由本地消息等待暂停；全局消息标记只守部分入口；微更新须地图且未淡出。"}
